# Django Project Structure Guide

This is a Django project focused on company data analysis, industrial chains, and regional information.

## Project Structure

- **[manage.py](mdc:manage.py)** - Django management script
- **[mysite/](mdc:mysite)** - Main Django project directory containing settings and configuration
  - **[mysite/settings.py](mdc:mysite/settings.py)** - Main Django settings file with database (MySQL), cache, authentication, and app configurations
  - **[mysite/urls.py](mdc:mysite/urls.py)** - Root URL configuration
  - **[mysite/wsgi.py](mdc:mysite/wsgi.py)** and **[mysite/asgi.py](mdc:mysite/asgi.py)** - WSGI/ASGI application entry points

- **[data_hall/](mdc:data_hall)** - Main Django app containing all business logic
  - **[data_hall/models.py](mdc:data_hall/models.py)** - Database models including CompanyInfo, IndustryChain, ChainPoint, regional data models
  - **[data_hall/views.py](mdc:data_hall/views.py)** - Main view functions (over 1000 lines)
  - **[data_hall/api_views.py](mdc:data_hall/api_views.py)** - REST API views using Django REST Framework
  - **[data_hall/urls.py](mdc:data_hall/urls.py)** - URL routing for both web pages and API endpoints
  - **[data_hall/forms.py](mdc:data_hall/forms.py)** - Django forms for user input handling
  - **[data_hall/serializers.py](mdc:data_hall/serializers.py)** - DRF serializers for API responses
  - **[data_hall/admin.py](mdc:data_hall/admin.py)** - Django admin configuration
  - **[data_hall/templates/](mdc:data_hall/templates)** - HTML templates
  - **[data_hall/static/](mdc:data_hall/static)** - Static files (CSS, JS, images)

## Key Features

- Company information management and ranking system
- Industrial chain analysis with hierarchical data structure
- Regional data (provinces, cities, districts) with tree-like relationships
- REST API endpoints for data access
- Authentication system with custom user management
- AI chat integration
- Interactive maps and data visualization
- Both regular and iframe versions of pages

## Database Models

The project uses MySQL database with key models:
- `CompanyInfo` - Core company data
- `CompanyRanking` - Company scoring and ranking
- `CompanyFinancing` - Financing information
- `IndustryChain` - Industrial chain definitions
- `ChainPoint` - Hierarchical chain points
- `Province`, `City`, `District` - Regional hierarchy

## API Structure

RESTful APIs are organized in **[data_hall/api_views.py](mdc:data_hall/api_views.py)** with endpoints for:
- Chain point management and enterprise filtering
- Regional data tree structure
- Company search and filtering

## Language & Localization

- Interface language: Chinese (zh-hans)
- Documentation and comments are in Chinese
- Database field names use English conventions with Chinese verbose names
